@host = http://localhost:8080
@access_token_owner = <user A — owner>
@access_token_member = <user B — member>
@room_id = <room id>

### Owner выпускает invite → 200, code1
POST {{host}}/api/v1/rooms/{{room_id}}/invite
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token_owner}}

# Status 200
# Body: {"code":"XXXXXXXX","createdBy":"<uid>","createdAt":"..."}
# Сохрани code как @code1.

### Owner перевыпускает invite → 200, code2 (≠ code1)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/rooms/{{room_id}}/invite
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token_owner}}

# Status 200
# code2 в body — другой, чем code1.
# В БД: старый invite revoked, новый active.

### Member пытается выпустить invite → 403 ROOM-004
POST {{host}}/api/v1/rooms/{{room_id}}/invite
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token_member}}

# Status 403
# Body: {"error":{"code":"ROOM-004","message":"insufficient role: admin or owner required"}}

### Использование code1 после перевыпуска → см. 04_join.http (ROOM-007)
